[00:00.00]作词 : Finneas O'Connell/Billie Eilish O'Connell
[00:01.00]作曲 : Finneas O'Connell/Billie Eilish O'Connell
[00:15.12] Things fall apart and time breaks your heart
[00:15.12] 世事无常 光阴易逝 徒留心碎
[00:21.53] I wasn't there, but I know
[00:21.53] 我未曾参与 却知晓那过往
[00:28.11] She was your girl, you showed her the world
[00:28.11] 她曾是你挚爱 你携她领略世间繁华
[00:34.17] You fell out of love and you both let go
[00:34.17] 而爱意消散 你俩选择彼此背离
[00:40.22] She was cryin' on my shoulder, all I could do was hold her
[00:40.22] 她依偎在我肩头哭泣 我也只能予她怀抱
[00:46.83] Only made us closer until July
[00:46.83] 到七月 我们都感情愈加深厚
[00:53.43] Now I know that you love me, you don't need to remind me
[00:53.43] 如今你爱的是我 无需多言
[00:59.88] I should put it all behind me, shouldn't I?
[00:59.88] 我也该放下过往 不是吗？
[01:04.75] But I see her in the back of my mind
[01:04.75] 可她挥之不去的倩影 浮现在我脑海深处
[01:11.59] All the time
[01:11.59] 挥之不去
[01:17.74] Like a fever, like I'm burning alive
[01:17.74] 仿佛害了发热 生生葬在火海
[01:24.39] Like a sign
[01:24.39] 挥之不去的预兆
[01:29.87]
[01:32.67] Did I cross the line?
[01:32.67] 我是否越了界？
[01:37.88] Mm, hm
[01:44.06]
[01:48.98] Well, good things don't last (good things don't last)
[01:48.98] 美好的事物难以恒久
[01:52.20] And life moves so fast (life moves so fast)
[01:52.20] 岁月如梭 转瞬即逝
[01:55.43] I'd never ask who was better (I'd never ask who was better)
[01:55.43] 我从未问过 究竟谁更胜一筹
[02:01.67] 'Cause she couldn't be (she couldn't be)
[02:01.67] 因为她与我相比
[02:05.26] More different from me (more different)
[02:05.26] 截然不同 大相径庭
[02:08.56] Happy and free (happy and free) in leather
[02:08.56] 身着皮衣 洒脱而自由
[02:14.51] And I know that you love me (you love me)
[02:14.51] 我知道你爱我
[02:18.04] You don't need to remind me (remind me)
[02:18.04] 无需多言
[02:20.82] Wanna put it all behind me, but baby
[02:20.82] 我也想放下过往 可亲爱的
[02:26.47] I see her in the back of my mind (back of my mind)
[02:26.47] 她挥之不去的倩影 浮现在我脑海深处
[02:32.61] All the time (all the time)
[02:32.61] 挥之不去
[02:38.96] Feels like a fever (like a fever), like I'm burning alive (burning alive)
[02:38.96] 仿佛害了发热 生生葬在火海
[02:45.68] Like a sign
[02:45.68] 挥之不去的预兆
[02:51.37]
[02:53.63] Did I cross the line?
[02:53.63] 我是否越了界？
[02:56.09] You say no one knows you so well (oh)
[02:56.09] 你说无人懂你如我深 无人能解你心意
[03:00.49]
[03:02.65] But every time you touch me, I just wonder how she felt
[03:02.65] 可每当肌肤相亲 我便浮想联翩 她此前是何感受
[03:08.56] Valentine's Day, cryin' in the hotel
[03:08.56] 情人节那天 不禁泪撒酒店
[03:13.91] I know you didn't mean to hurt me, so I kept it to myself
[03:13.91] 我知道你并非有意伤我 所以我选择缄默
[03:21.18] And I wonder
[03:21.18] 我忍不住想
[03:24.47] Do you see her in the back of your mind?
[03:24.47] 于你而言 她是否挥之不去 藏在你思绪深处
[03:31.29] In my eyes?
[03:31.29] 映在我的眸子里？
[03:35.66]
